{"metadata":{"externalID":"c:objc(cs)PushwooshConfig(cm)setAdditionalAuthorizationOptions:","fragments":[{"text":"+ ","kind":"text"},{"text":"setAdditionalAuthorizationOptions:","kind":"identifier"}],"navigatorTitle":[{"kind":"identifier","text":"setAdditionalAuthorizationOptions:"}],"modules":[{"name":"PushwooshCore"}],"symbolKind":"method","title":"setAdditionalAuthorizationOptions:","role":"symbol","roleHeading":"Type Method"},"kind":"symbol","primaryContentSections":[{"kind":"declarations","declarations":[{"languages":["occ"],"platforms":["iOS"],"tokens":[{"kind":"text","text":"+ ("},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"void","preciseIdentifier":"c:v"},{"kind":"text","text":") "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"setAdditionalAuthorizationOptions:"},{"kind":"text","text":"("},{"text":"UNAuthorizationOptions","kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"c:@E@UNAuthorizationOptions"},{"text":") ","kind":"text"},{"text":"options","kind":"internalParam"},{"kind":"text","text":";"}]}]},{"kind":"parameters","parameters":[{"name":"options","content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"The additional ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"UNAuthorizationOptions"},{"text":" to request.","type":"text"}]}]}]},{"kind":"content","content":[{"text":"Discussion","anchor":"discussion","level":2,"type":"heading"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"When calling "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"registerForPushNotifications"},{"type":"text","text":", the SDK requests these permissions by default:"}]},{"type":"unorderedList","items":[{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"code":"UNAuthorizationOptionBadge","type":"codeVoice"}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"code":"UNAuthorizationOptionSound","type":"codeVoice"}]}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":"UNAuthorizationOptionAlert"}]}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":"UNAuthorizationOpti